  "id": "COMPOUND:24335 - PROTEIN:5805",
  "verbalization": "Peperomin B is implicated in the biological activity of SCCH-26 through a series of molecular interactions. The evidence suggests that Peperomin B acts as a target for MOVP-3, which in turn is targeted by Cocosamide B or Npc15336, and all these intermediates ultimately target SCCH-26. This chain of targets indicates a potential pathway through which Peperomin B may influence SCCH-26, though the exact mechanism of action remains to be elucidated. The consistent presence of MOVP-3 as a common intermediate across different targets suggests a possible role in mediating the interaction between Peperomin B and SCCH-26. The integration of these pathways highlights the complexity of the relationship, emphasizing the importance of further investigation into the functional roles of these intermediates.",
